# Sao chép: cp secrets/backend_pipes.env.example secrets/backend_pipes.env
# Chỉ điền credential OWNED. Không paste dump Acc_all/stealer.

# Mapping user/token sở hữu — scripts load qua owned_credentials.py
# Session gom: python3 scripts/order_session_env.py export|ensure
# Xem thêm: order_session.env.example · docs/ORDER-SESSION-ENV.md

# Pancake POS — login session (Bearer) + order API key
